    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160080",
      "en": "This is it: the very heart of the Citadel. The pinnacle of galactic power. Kind of makes your head spin if you think about it too much.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160082",
      "en": "So this is where the Council passes judgment on all us little folk, huh? Ever get the feeling we're in over our heads, Commander?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160084",
      "en": "Think of all the important decisions the Council has made right here. Trillions of lives hanging on their every word and deed. It is awe-inspiring!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160086",
      "en": "Through all my time at C-Sec, I-- I never got the chance to witness a meeting of the Council in person.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160088",
      "en": "I've always wondered if the turians released the genophage on their own, or if the Council secretly encouraged them.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160090",
      "en": "Three hundred years ago, the geth drove my people into exile. We asked the Council to wipe the synthetics out, but they ignored our pleas.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160091",
      "en": "Maybe if they'd listened, we wouldn't be here now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160092",
      "en": "Maybe if they'd listened, we wouldn't be here now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA70_02_DSG_LOC|sta70_banter_01_D|160093",
